      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello! \n\nAudio Filters aren't copied from the reference camera to the one used at runtime, but you can achieve what you're trying to do by adding an Audio Reverb Zone to your scene and checking \"Bypass Reverb Zones\" on your music AudioSource.\n\nHowever, be aware that there is currently a known issue specifically affecting player voices and reverb zones: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/audio-reverb-zone-stopped-echoing-back-the-players-voice-in-recent-bulild",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
